	"FriendlyName": "InoOnnx",
	"Description": "ONNX Runtime packaged for Unreal Engine: in-process ONNX model inference on Win64 / Android / macOS / iOS, with DirectML GPU+NPU acceleration on Windows, CoreML on Apple and NNAPI/XNNPACK on Android. Exposes a RAII, move-safe FInoOnnxSession / FInoOnnxTensor wrapper over ORT's C API. Ships a binary-patched ONNX Runtime and Microsoft's proprietary DirectML — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md before shipping.",
